# Locale catalog from API

Do not hardcode UI language labels (`Tiếng Việt`, `English`) or flag emojis in FE messages or switcher ternaries.

- Catalog: `GET /api/v1/reference/locales` → `code`, `name`, `native_name`, `emoji`, `is_default`
- Switcher display: `emoji` + `native_name`
- next-intl `routing.locales` stays build-time for `messages/*.json` only; intersect API codes with that list before `router.replace`

See `docs/architecture/i18n.md` and `docs/architecture/frontend-feature-playbook.md`.
